        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Sizemore, Wesley Snipes, Bruce Payne, Richard Nord, David Finfer, Dean Goodhill, Don Brochu, Dov Hoenig, Dennis Virkler\n- Works: Born on the Fourth of July, Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man, Passenger 57, True Romance, Natural Born Killers, Strange Days, Heat, Saving Private Ryan, Red Planet, Black Hawk Down, Pearl Harbor, The Fugitive\n- Roles: supporting roles, film editor, voice role\n- Products: video game\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in Born on the Fourth of July (1989) and Harley Davidson and the Marlboro Man (1991).\n- Passenger 57 (1992) stars Wesley Snipes and Bruce Payne.\n- Tom Sizemore is known for a supporting role in Passenger 57 (1992).\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in True Romance (1993), Natural Born Killers (1994), Strange Days (1995), and Heat (1995).\n- Richard Nord is a film editor best known for The Fugitive and Passenger 57.\n- Tom Sizemore is known for supporting roles in Saving Private Ryan (1998), Red Planet (2000), Black Hawk Down (2001), and Pearl Harbor (2001).\n- Tom Sizemore voiced Sonny Forelli in a video game.\n- David Finfer shared a nomination with Dean Goodhill, Don Brochu, Richard Nord, Dov Hoenig, and Dennis Virkler.",
